{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的长句在短时间扫屏时不如X的加亮关键词醒目，而且对音乐细部变化的描写有所减少。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点加亮和细密的音乐感受词，让人容易快速捕捉关键词，也能获得更多细微的听觉和身体感受。但Y把人物为什么靠近、为什么退缩、为什么重新鼓起勇气，以及为什么最终不再隐藏喜欢，交代得更完整，情绪转变之间有清楚的因果联系。作为没读过原文、边听边看的普通观众，我更容易通过Y理解这个人，并把14段看成一段连续而有层次的心理历程，因此整体选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6eb2a9a1-d018-44a8-95c6-d18699712a4d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T235012048092Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:52:33.988835+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "71386e2c0b23a84ee709c3e04e43829d87bb69d4170f78bedf1dd437ecd63679", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py